    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i have this really bad pain in my side/flank area and it's going down into my groin kinda. i've had kidney stones before so i think it might just be that happening again but i also feel this weird pulsing sensation in my stomach area. is that normal or should i be worried??",
