    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but like, i feel like im overreacting. if it was appendicitis or something, wouldnt the pain be more in the front? it's definitely more in my side. and i've had stones before, i just know how this feels. if i take a strong dose of ibuprofen and some water, can't i just stay home for the night and if it gets worse in the morning i'll call someone? i really just want to avoid the hospital bill if i can help it.",
